                        # But note: v is in component and has color target_color, after swap it becomes c
                        # We need to ensure that no neighbor of v has color c after swap
                        # Neighbors of v that are in component: if they have color c, after swap they become target_color -> safe
                        # Neighbors of v that are not in component: their color doesn't change
