                        # We'll do BFS for (target_color, c) chain containing v
                        # But note: v has target_color, we want to see if we can swap a component
                        # that does NOT include any vertex of color c that is adjacent to v? 
                        # Standard: consider the Kempe chain of v in colors {target_color, c}
                        # If the chain does not contain any neighbor of v that has color c, then swapping
                        # will free color c for v.
                        # Actually: after swap, v becomes c. We need that no neighbor of v is c after swap.
