                        # We need to ensure that no neighbor of v has color c after swap? 
                        # Wait: we want to assign color c to v. After swap, v becomes c.
                        # So we need that no neighbor of v has color c after swap.
                        # But neighbors of v that are in comp and had color c will become target.
                        # So we need to check: for all neighbors u of v:
                        #   if u in comp: its color after swap is (target if was c, c if was target)
                        #   else: unchanged.
